00:28:39,000 --> 00:28:42,000
The Guide to Advancement 2013,,

424
00:28:42,000 --> 00:28:44,000
the Guide to Safe Scouting

425
00:28:44,000 --> 00:28:47,000
and the Guide to Uniforms and Insignia.

