00:29:23,000 --> 00:29:26,000
The requirements are written in stone.

442
00:29:26,000 --> 00:29:27,000
You can't add to them.

443
00:29:27,000 --> 00:29:29,000
You can't subtract from them.

444
00:29:29,000 --> 00:29:30,000
Nobody can.

